"What a special celebration at Mildred’s this weekend. 💛\n\nIt was an honour to welcome the incredible Dr. Jean Augustine as she celebrated her 89th birthday with Jully Black and friends.\n\nA trailblazer, changemaker, and the first Black woman elected to Canada’s Parliament, Dr. Augustine’s legacy continues to inspire generations.\n\nAnd we couldn’t help but notice the perfect coincidence, our Mildred’s crew showing off their ‘89 shirts for the birthday girl. ✨\n\nThank you for celebrating with us, Dr. Augustine. Wishing you the happiest 89th birthday from everyone here at Mildred’s! 🎂🥂💛"